    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Restyle: the look, on H3's motion\n\nAn image model re-paints every H3 frame in the chosen look, with the previous painted frame carried along the video's motion and mixed in - the feedback that made Deforum morph and AnimateDiff boil.\n\n- `deforum morph` smear, `animatediff boil` re-rolling texture, `disco flicker`, `clean restyle`.\n- `denoise` 0.3 keeps H3's image, 0.6 re-imagines it. Switch off for the clean H3 render."
   ]
  },
